  "guide.l1.title": "Phrase entry blend",
  "guide.l1.s1": "Load a track on A and a different one on B.",
  "guide.l1.h1": "Use Load A / Load B in the library, or drag rows onto the decks.",
  "guide.l1.s2": "Wait — analysing beats, key and structure locally.",
  "guide.l1.s3": "Listen to the 4-beat loop; press ✓ if the kick sits on 1, or nudge B.",
  "guide.l1.h3": "The loop plays on CUE. ±1 beat moves bar 1; ±10 ms shifts the grid.",
  "guide.l1.s4": "Press PLAY on A. You are on air.",
  "guide.l1.s5": "Press ENTER — B will start on A's next bar 1.",
  "guide.l1.h5": "Tempo is matched first; B starts from its first downbeat, sample-accurately.",
  "guide.l1.s6": "Are the kicks together? Nudge B if not.",
  "guide.l1.h6": "Hold − or + on B to bend it by 2 %. The phase meter appears after 4 bars.",
  "guide.l1.s7": "Move the crossfader to the middle over 8 bars.",
  "guide.l1.h7": "Stay between 40 and 60 for 4 bars.",
  "guide.l1.s8": "Turn A's LOW down as you turn B's LOW up.",
  "guide.l1.h8": "Double-tap LOW to kill it. Swap on a bar 1.",
  "guide.l1.s9": "Bring the fader to B. A will stop.",
